{"id":512,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と奉仕を育てる雙葉女子教育","feature_description":"福岡雙葉中学校は、カトリック精神に基づく女子教育を土台に、探究を発展させた学びと奉仕を重視しています。部活動は希望制で、文化系・運動系・同好会が整い、学校生活の中で協働や表現を伸ばしやすいのが特徴です。1日の流れや年間予定も公開されています。日々の積み重ねで自分の役割を見つけ、学習と活動を両立しやすい環境です。学校生活の見通しも立てやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":10062,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10063,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10064,"name":"キリスト教研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10065,"name":"ホームメイキング部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10066,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10067,"name":"新聞部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10068,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10069,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10070,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10071,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10072,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10073,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fukuokafutaba.ed.jp/jh_school/life/club.h